  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Labour, Employment and Mobility  Actions of the AU-ILO-IOM Joint Programme on Labour Migration Governance for Development and Integration in Africa (JLMP Lead Project): 2022-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to contribute to the vision of strengthening the effective, rights-based and gender-responsive governance and regulation of labour migration and mobility, under the rule of law and with the involvement of key stakeholders across governments, legislators, decision-makers, social partners, migrants, international organizations, private sector, NGOs, diaspora organizations and civil society organizations.</narrative>
  </description>
